  "title": "JBT Marel supports the modernization of India’s poultry industry",
  "summary": "With a population of 1.47 billion, India has the potential to be the largest poultry market in the world. No wonder India’s poultry industry is rapidly transforming. As urban lifestyles change and consumer expectations rise, the demand for safe, high-quality, and convenient poultry products is growing fast. In this evolving market, JBT Marel can be a key partner for processors who are looking to modernize and scale their operations.",
